cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AutoHS
message: >-
  If you use AutoHS, please cite the software record below, the hippocampal
  asymmetry publication, and any third-party tools or datasets you used
  (FreeSurfer, FastSurfer, IDEAS, etc.).
type: software
authors:
