    value: https://github.com/phindagijimana/AutoHS
repository-code: https://github.com/phindagijimana/AutoHS
url: https://autohs.readthedocs.io
abstract: >-
  AutoHS is a BIDS App for automated hippocampal sclerosis screening from
  T1-weighted MRI. It performs hippocampal segmentation (FreeSurfer or
  FastSurfer), computes hippocampal volumes and the asymmetry index, and
  generates clinical reports.
keywords:
  - BIDS App
  - hippocampal sclerosis
  - epilepsy
  - FreeSurfer
  - FastSurfer
  - neuroimaging
